	// Judgement Ring patterns. A recipe picks one with "ring": "<name>", or lists its own
	// areas the same way. Each area:
	//   "at"      position along the ring, 0 (start) .. 1 (end)
	//   "width"   hit area size, relative to the normal width (which grows with skill,
	//             catalysts and traits)
	//   "strike"  strike area size, relative to the normal strike width
